423
00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:50.720
cada hipótese no lugar certo.

424
00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:52.860
Nunca apaga, nunca reescreve,

425
00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.980
nunca resume a ponto de perder o

426
00:12:54.980 --> 00:12:55.480
